      "content": "makes sense. so basically it's a matter of avoiding a single point of failure. could you add a sentence or two about the cost management aspect too? specifically how auto scaling helps us avoid paying for huge instances that we aren't actually using during off-peak hours. just making sure the stakeholder sees the ROI.",
